In sympy/printing/pycode.py, class PythonCodePrinter, add these two methods exactly:
```python
def _print_Min(self, expr):
    return "min({})".format(", ".join(self._print(arg) for arg in expr.args))

def _print_Max(self, expr):
    return "max({})".format(", ".join(self._print(arg) for arg in expr.args))
```
Change nothing else. Run `bin/test sympy/printing/tests/test_pycode.py` and report the result line.
